# What the stylesheet has to work in.
#
# Obsidian's desktop installer for 1.11 ships Electron 39.2, and browserslist
# resolves that to its Chromium (142 at the time of writing) — so the number to
# maintain here is an Electron version, which is the one Obsidian publishes,
# rather than a Chromium version nobody states directly.
#
# Two things this deliberately does not claim:
#
#  - **It is not the mobile floor.** Obsidian on a phone runs in the system
#    WebView, which can be older than the desktop's Chromium and is not one
#    version to pin. Passing here is therefore necessary and not sufficient.
#  - **It is not Obsidian's own baseline.** Their check names an app version
#    ("Obsidian 1.11.4"); this one names the browser underneath it. For the
#    finding that prompted all this — `clip-path`, BC_E3_S89 — both flag it, at
#    every Chromium there is, so the difference did not matter. Where it does
#    matter, theirs is the one that decides.
electron 39.2
